  "limits": [
    "Node VM simulates logic and DOM registrations; no RAF cadence, GPU, physical mouse, real touch or Android performance measurement.",
    "Final campaigns use ordinary controls and real answer actions only. The operator has exact positions and answer keys; Parallax/MRG retain exact internal attack state access. This proves reachability, not human fairness, learning or entertainment.",
    "The final normal run used orbital260 bomber/visible-projectile priority before the later optional low-health resupply enhancement; resupply was not used in this recorded run.",
